{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19157","headline":"和令狐相公初归京国赋诗言怀 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公初归京国赋诗言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌云羽翮掞天才，扬历中枢与外台。\n相印昔辞东阁去，将星还拱北辰来。\n殿庭捧日彯缨入，阁道看山曳履回。\n口不言功心自适，吟诗酿酒待花开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}